WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.975
The timeline of the scandal reveals a systemic failure.

00:00:03.925 --> 00:00:13.037
The Senate Internal Economy Committee triggered a Deloitte audit, exposing questionable claims by Senators Duffy, Wallin, Brazeau, and Harb.

00:00:13.037 --> 00:00:17.512
The Prime Minister's Office scrambled to contain the political damage.
